  "prefLabel": "Env-Wt 104.28 Statutory permit-by-notification (SPN)",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wt 104.28 “Statutory permit-by-notification (SPN)” means a permit obtained by complying with the statutory requirements specified in RSA 482-A:3, IV-a, V, XII, XV, or XVI, as applicable, as clarified in Env-Wt 308 and relevant portions of Env-Wt 500.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1, #2, #3, and #4 at Chapter heading for Env-Wt 100) #12801, eff 12-15-19; renumbered by #13945 (formerly Env-Wt 104.26)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wt100.html"
